### Base map

<ul class="c-swatches" role="list"><%= colour_swatch('black-tint-95', role: 'Land', fields: %i[hex rgb]) %><%= colour_swatch('black-tint-80', role: 'Land outline', fields: %i[hex rgb]) %><%= colour_swatch('teal-tint-95', role: 'Sea', fields: %i[hex rgb]) %><%= colour_swatch('teal-tint-80', role: 'Coastal areas', fields: %i[hex rgb]) %></ul>

Accent green has low contrast with Black tint 95% land. The Primary green outline gives each zone or marker the 3:1 it needs, and a Black name or letter identifies it.

